From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:56:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 50/50] Raikou and Entei wait in the Burned Tower B1F instead
 of roaming

The release scene no longer makes them roamers. From the next visit to B1F
each waits where it slept, at Lv. 46, and is fought like the static Suicune:
caught, it is gone; beaten or fled from, it is back after the next Hall of
Fame. Made by tools/hack/beasts_stay.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEYSk2h6k1E1jWo3cHd
